From 44b79a7656bb78eb1961d273666fefe98e94e4bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: michael <lukakcollwarm@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 03:51:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(onboarding): add a dismissible Getting started checklist
 for new members

New members landed in a workspace with no guidance on what to do first.
Add a Getting started card to the workspace home with four steps that
match existing features: add a profile photo, say hello in a channel,
send a direct message and join a Buzz call.

- steps tick themselves off: the photo from the user's profile, messages
  when sent from a channel or DM, Buzz when a call is joined
- each open step has a button that takes you there
- the card can be dismissed and stays dismissed, and it disappears once
  every step is done
- progress is saved in this browser per organisation and user (v1);
  saving it to the account is a follow-up for zedu-be
- node:test unit tests for the progress logic

Refs zeduchat/zedu-fe#552
